cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Principle of Action — Executable Code of Volume 4 (Unified Computational Modeling)"
message: "If this code is useful to your work, please cite the complete series."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Executable Python code accompanying the English edition of Volume 4,
  "Unified Computational Modeling — Simulations in Physics, Biochemistry and
  Medicine", of the four-volume series "The Principle of Action". It contains
  every code example, the answer keys to the challenge exercises and the
  scripts that reproduce all 22 technical figures of the book. Educational
  material only; not a medical device.
